palm trees and placed between them [fields of] crops.","j":15,"h":30,"s":18,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"18:33","t":"Each of the two gardens produced its fruit and did not fall short thereof in anything. And We caused to gush forth within them a river.","j":15,"h":30,"s":18,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"18:34","t":"And he had fruit, so he said to his companion while he was conversing with him, \"I am greater than you in wealth and mightier in [numbers of] men.\"","j":15,"h":30,"s":18,"a":34,"sd":null}],"juz":15,"hizb":30,"surahs":[18],"sajdah":false}